        "pageimage": "SchildsLadder.jpg",
        "extract": "Schild's Ladder is a 2002 science fiction novel by Australian author Greg Egan.  The book derives its name from Schild's ladder, a construction in differential geometry, devised by the mathematician and physicist Alfred Schild.",
